 # Architecture
 
 This file stores cross-cutting rules that apply to the whole repo and to projects cloned from it.
+Keep Web-standards-only Worker production source free of Node built-in imports and enforce that boundary in the normal quality gate.
+Enable logs and sampled traces explicitly in committed Wrangler configuration.
+Compose optional browser compilation with every existing application build instead of replacing Wrangler's custom-build slot.
+Pass one validated explicit Wrangler environment through every deployment lifecycle command.
